  "setup": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "label": "starting scores",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "score",
            "value": {
              "calc": "starting_score"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "label": "the pack",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[strength_7, strength_8, strength_A, strength_K, strength_Q, strength_J, strength_10, strength_9] + [strength_7, strength_8, strength_A, strength_K, strength_Q, strength_J, strength_10, strength_9] + [strength_7, strength_8, strength_A, strength_K, strength_Q, strength_J, strength_10, strength_9] + [strength_7, strength_8, strength_A, strength_K, strength_Q, strength_J, strength_10, strength_9]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "label": "the rules",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Rank order, highest first: 7 (strength {strength_7}), 8 ({strength_8}), A ({strength_A}), K ({strength_K}), Q ({strength_Q}), J ({strength_J}), 10 ({strength_10}), 9 ({strength_9}). Stakes: both STAY {value_both_stay} point; ACCEPT {value_accept}; FOUR {value_four}; both TWO MORE {value_both_raise}; a FOLD gives the raiser {fold_payout}. First to {win_target} wins."
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "deal",
      "label": "new round",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "round_number",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[strength_7, strength_8, strength_A, strength_K, strength_Q, strength_J, strength_10, strength_9] + [strength_7, strength_8, strength_A, strength_K, strength_Q, strength_J, strength_10, strength_9] + [strength_7, strength_8, strength_A, strength_K, strength_Q, strength_J, strength_10, strength_9] + [strength_7, strength_8, strength_A, strength_K, strength_Q, strength_J, strength_10, strength_9]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "played_cards",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "raise_choice",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "order_choice",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "trick_pick",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "card_offer",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "order_offer",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "tricks_won",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "round_value",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "raiser",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "response",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "folded",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "trick1_winner",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "trick2_winner",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "trick3_winner",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "round_winner",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Round {round_number} begins."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "deal",
      "label": "deal",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(int(uniform(0, len(deck))), len(deck) - 1)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": 1,
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(int(uniform(0, len(deck))), len(deck) - 1)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": 1,
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(int(uniform(0, len(deck))), len(deck) - 1)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": 1,
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(int(uniform(0, len(deck))), len(deck) - 1)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": 2,
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(int(uniform(0, len(deck))), len(deck) - 1)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": 2,
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(int(uniform(0, len(deck))), len(deck) - 1)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": 2,
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "card_offer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[['9', '10', 'J', 'Q', 'K', 'A', '8', '7'][c - 1] for c in you.hand]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "phase": "deal",
      "label": "your hand",
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "fields": [
        "hand",
        "card_offer",
        "score"
      ],
      "text": "Your hand as strengths (8=7, 7=8, 6=A, 5=K, 4=Q, 3=J, 2=10, 1=9) and as rank names:"
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "trick 1",
      "label": "first trick",
      "to": "acting",
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "card_offer"
        }
      },
      "store": "trick_pick",
      "text": "Trick 1: choose one card from your hand to play, by rank name. Your opponent chooses at the same moment."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "trick 1",
      "label": "resolve trick 1",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "trick_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sum(s for s in [strength_9, strength_10, strength_J, strength_Q, strength_K, strength_A, strength_8, strength_7] if ['9', '10', 'J', 'Q', 'K', 'A', '8', '7'][s - 1] == you.trick_pick)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "trick_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.trick_card if you.trick_card in you.hand else you.hand[0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "played_cards",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.trick_card"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.trick_card"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "seat1_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[0].played_cards[0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "seat2_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[1].played_cards[0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "trick1_winner",
            "value": {
              "calc": "1 if seat1_card > seat2_card else (2 if seat2_card > seat1_card else 0)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == trick1_winner"
            },
            "key": "tricks_won",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "order_offer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[['9', '10', 'J', 'Q', 'K', 'A', '8', '7'][you.hand[0] - 1] + ' first, then ' + ['9', '10', 'J', 'Q', 'K', 'A', '8', '7'][you.hand[1] - 1], ['9', '10', 'J', 'Q', 'K', 'A', '8', '7'][you.hand[1] - 1] + ' first, then ' + ['9', '10', 'J', 'Q', 'K', 'A', '8', '7'][you.hand[0] - 1]]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "trick 1",
      "label": "trick 1 revealed",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Trick 1: seat 1 played strength {seat1_card}, seat 2 played strength {seat2_card}. Trick 1 goes to seat {trick1_winner} (0 means spoilt)."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "stakes",
      "label": "raise poll",
      "to": "acting",
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "STAY",
          "TWO MORE"
        ]
      },
      "store": "raise_choice",
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} chose {value}."
      },
      "text": "Choose STAY or TWO MORE, secretly and at the same time as your opponent. Both STAY: the round is worth {value_both_stay}. Both TWO MORE: worth {value_both_raise}, nobody may fold. If only you say TWO MORE, your opponent answers ACCEPT ({value_accept}), FOLD (you score {fold_payout} and the round ends) or FOUR ({value_four}, you may not fold)."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "stakes",
      "label": "settle the raise",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "round_value",
            "value": {
              "calc": "value_both_stay"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.raise_choice == 'STAY' for p in players) == 2"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "round_value",
            "value": {
              "calc": "value_both_raise"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.raise_choice == 'TWO MORE' for p in players) == 2"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "raiser",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sum(p.seat for p in players if p.raise_choice == 'TWO MORE')"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.raise_choice == 'TWO MORE' for p in players) == 1"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "stakes",
      "label": "response",
      "when": {
        "calc": "raiser != 0"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "raiser != 0 and you.seat != raiser"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "ACCEPT",
          "FOLD",
          "FOUR"
        ]
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "resp"
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} answers the raise: {value}."
      },
      "text": "Your opponent raised TWO MORE. Answer ACCEPT (round worth {value_accept}), FOLD (your opponent scores {fold_payout}, you score nothing, and the round ends now) or FOUR (round worth {value_four}; your opponent may not fold)."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "stakes",
      "label": "apply the response",
      "when": {
        "calc": "raiser != 0"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "response",
            "value": "$resp"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "round_value",
            "value": {
              "calc": "value_accept"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "response == 'ACCEPT'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "round_value",
            "value": {
              "calc": "value_four"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "response == 'FOUR'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "raiser"
            },
            "key": "score",
            "value": {
              "calc": "fold_payout"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "response == 'FOLD'"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} wins the round by fold."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "round_winner",
            "value": {
              "calc": "raiser"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "response == 'FOLD'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "folded",
            "value": true,
            "if": {
              "calc": "response == 'FOLD'"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "last tricks",
      "label": "order of last two cards",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not folded"
      },
      "to": "acting",
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "order_offer"
        }
      },
      "store": "order_choice",
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} plays: {value}."
      },
      "text": "Choose the order of your two remaining cards: the first is played in trick 2, the second in trick 3. Your opponent chooses at the same moment."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "last tricks",
      "label": "tricks 2 and 3",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not folded"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "rev",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.order_choice == you.order_offer[1] and you.order_choice != you.order_offer[0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "played_cards",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.hand[1] if you.rev else you.hand[0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "played_cards",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.hand[0] if you.rev else you.hand[1]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "seat1_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[0].played_cards[1]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "seat2_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[1].played_cards[1]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "trick2_winner",
            "value": {
              "calc": "1 if seat1_card > seat2_card else (2 if seat2_card > seat1_card else 0)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == trick2_winner"
            },
            "key": "tricks_won",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "seat1_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[0].played_cards[2]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "seat2_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[1].played_cards[2]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "trick3_winner",
            "value": {
              "calc": "1 if seat1_card > seat2_card else (2 if seat2_card > seat1_card else 0)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == trick3_winner"
            },
            "key": "tricks_won",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "round_winner",
            "value": {
              "calc": "1 if players[0].tricks_won > players[1].tricks_won else (2 if players[1].tricks_won > players[0].tricks_won else (trick1_winner if trick1_winner != 0 else (trick2_winner if trick2_winner != 0 else trick3_winner)))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == round_winner"
            },
            "key": "score",
            "value": {
              "calc": "round_value"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "last tricks",
      "label": "round result",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Round {round_number} over. Played cards (strengths, in trick order): seat 1 {players[0].played_cards}, seat 2 {players[1].played_cards}. Trick winners: {trick1_winner}, {trick2_winner}, {trick3_winner} (0 = spoilt or not played). Fold: {folded}. Round winner: seat {round_winner} (0 = void). Round value: {round_value}. Scores: seat 1 {players[0].score}, seat 2 {players[1].score}."
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "end",
      "label": "end check",
      "when": {
        "calc": "max([p.score for p in players]) >= win_target or round_number >= round_cap"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "max([p.score for p in players]) >= win_target or round_number >= round_cap"
      },
      "rank_by": "you.score",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Final scores: Seat 1 {players[0].score}, Seat 2 {players[1].score}; target {win_target}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 30,
    "rounds_max": 30,
    "actions_max": 1000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "Two players. The pack has {deck_size} cards: {copies_per_rank} cards of each of {ranks} ranks; suits do not matter. Rank strength from highest to lowest: 7 ({strength_7}), 8 ({strength_8}), A ({strength_A}), K ({strength_K}), Q ({strength_Q}), J ({strength_J}), 10 ({strength_10}), 9 ({strength_9}). Both players start at {starting_score} points.\n\nEach round:\n1. Deal. The full pack is shuffled and {hand_size} cards are dealt privately to each player. Each player sees only their own hand.\n2. First trick. Both players secretly and simultaneously choose one card from their hand to play. If a player names a card not in their hand, their first-listed card is played. Both cards are revealed. The higher strength wins trick 1. Equal strength means trick 1 is spoilt and belongs to no one.\n3. Raise poll. Both players secretly and simultaneously choose STAY or TWO MORE. The choices are then revealed. Both STAY: the round is worth {value_both_stay} point. Both TWO MORE: the round is worth {value_both_raise} points, and no one may fold. Exactly one TWO MORE: that player is the raiser. The other player, the responder, answers once with ACCEPT, FOLD or FOUR. ACCEPT: the round is worth {value_accept} points. FOLD: the raiser immediately scores {fold_payout} point, the responder scores nothing, and the round ends (no more cards are played). FOUR: the round is worth {value_four} points, and the raiser may not fold.\n4. Last two tricks. Each player secretly and simultaneously chooses the order in which they will play their two remaining cards (first, then second). If a player's answer is invalid, their two cards are played in the order they were dealt. Trick 2 compares each player's first card; trick 3 compares each player's second card. In each trick, higher strength wins and equal strength is spoilt.\n5. Round winner. The player who won more of the three tricks wins the round. If both won the same number, the winner of the earliest trick that was not spoilt wins the round. If all three tricks were spoilt, the round is void and no one scores.\n6. Scoring. The round winner adds the round's value (1, 2 or 4) to their score; the other player's score is unchanged.\n7. End check. If a player has {win_target} or more points, the game ends and that player wins.\n\nIf {round_cap} rounds have been played and no one has reached {win_target}, the game ends: the higher score wins, and equal scores are a draw (a shared win). There is no talk phase: all information comes from revealed cards and choices."
}
